00:20:54,480 --> 00:20:57,200
male and female He created them.

535
00:20:57,200 --> 00:21:00,400
所以首先我們看到神說什麼?

536
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:03,600
Let us,又是這個什麼form?

537
00:21:03,600 --> 00:21:06,880
Singular or plural,這個是plural。

538
00:21:06,880 --> 00:21:10,280
Let us, God the Father, the Son, and the Holy Spirit,

539
00:21:10,280 --> 00:21:16,000
這個Trinity三為一體就說我們一起去創造人,是嗎?

540
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:17,400
那麼這個人是怎樣的?

541
00:21:17,400 --> 00:21:20,680
這個人是made in what likeness?

542
00:21:20,680 --> 00:21:25,200
In God's likeness,OK?

543
00:21:25,200 --> 00:21:27,000
所以我們會看五樣東西。

544
00:21:27,000 --> 00:21:31,080
Humanity,我們看了Trinity, Cosmology,

545
00:21:31,080 --> 00:21:33,080
and now we look at humanity.

546
00:21:33,080 --> 00:21:37,600
神創造人在祂的,in His image.

547
00:21:37,600 --> 00:21:40,680
Five things we look at,第一是什麼?

548
00:21:40,680 --> 00:21:44,280
Relationship, God created us for a relationship.

549
00:21:44,280 --> 00:21:46,200
神為什麼創造你?

550
00:21:46,200 --> 00:21:49,480
祂想跟你有一個relationship,

551
00:21:49,480 --> 00:21:53,080
God wants a relationship with us,是嗎?

552
00:21:53,080 --> 00:21:55,880
神創造了這麼多東西,

553
00:21:55,880 --> 00:22:00,480
is to have a relationship with you,明白嗎?

554
00:22:00,480 --> 00:22:06,000
神創造了光、地、水、太陽、月亮,

555
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:09,800
all to have a relationship with you.

556
00:22:09,800 --> 00:22:13,200
Tell your neighbor, God created you to have a relationship with you.

557
00:22:13,200 --> 00:22:17,880
跟你的鄰居說,第二個R是Roles.

558
00:22:17,880 --> 00:22:19,680
Roles,OK?

559
00:22:19,680 --> 00:22:23,200
那麼God made them什麼?

560
00:22:23,200 --> 00:22:26,280
Male and female.

561
00:22:26,280 --> 00:22:29,480
Male and female 有不同的role,是嗎?

562
00:22:29,480 --> 00:22:32,480
Male and female are equal,是嗎?

563
00:22:32,480 --> 00:22:37,080
神愛男孩多於女孩,OK?

564
00:22:37,080 --> 00:22:41,600
神是兩個都愛的,男和女都愛的,是equal的,

565
00:22:41,600 --> 00:22:43,680
但是有distinction,OK?

566
00:22:43,680 --> 00:22:48,080
We are created with distinction,different,OK?

567
00:22:48,080 --> 00:22:51,480
第三是Role,我們的Role是什麼?

568
00:22:51,480 --> 00:22:55,080
Go and be fruitful,right?

569
00:22:55,080 --> 00:22:57,480
Go and multiply.

570
00:22:57,480 --> 00:23:00,280
Go and be stewards of the earth.

571
00:23:00,280 --> 00:23:03,080
Oh,sorry,我講了reproduction.

572
00:23:03,080 --> 00:23:04,880
OK,第四是reproduction,

573
00:23:04,880 --> 00:23:08,080
Go and multiply, be fruitful,OK?

574
00:23:08,080 --> 00:23:12,680
然後第五,下個禮拜我們會看God wants us also,

575
00:23:12,680 --> 00:23:15,280
created us for rest,OK?

576
00:23:15,280 --> 00:23:17,280
不是單止做事的,

577
00:23:17,280 --> 00:23:19,680
我們是God created us for work,

578
00:23:19,680 --> 00:23:24,080
but He also created us for rest, for rest.

579
00:23:24,080 --> 00:23:25,680
OK,let's invite Nathan.

580
00:23:25,680 --> 00:23:30,680
Nathan is going to come up and share a story.

581
00:23:30,680 --> 00:23:32,680
你回教會多久?講了多久?

582
00:23:32,680 --> 00:23:35,080
我從出世回到現在。

583
00:23:35,080 --> 00:23:40,080
Wow,是不是20年了?

584
00:23:40,080 --> 00:23:41,080
20 years?

585
00:23:41,080 --> 00:23:43,080
差不多,20 years,OK.

586
00:23:43,080 --> 00:23:45,880
在這個Creation story,你學到什麼?

587
00:23:45,880 --> 00:23:49,080
What is the key thing that you took away?

588
00:23:49,080 --> 00:23:52,880
就是你剛剛講的那個,我們有什麼Role,

589
00:23:52,880 --> 00:23:56,880
因為我們是按照神的形象去做出來的,

590
00:23:56,880 --> 00:24:03,280
我們就要用,我們要去act out祂給我們的plan.

591
00:24:03,280 --> 00:24:04,680
OK,that's very good.

592
00:24:04,680 --> 00:24:08,280
那你覺得神的plan for you是什麼?

593
00:24:08,280 --> 00:24:11,880
你怎麼,這個禮拜怎麼act out到祂的plan?

594
00:24:11,880 --> 00:24:15,080
因為我上個禮拜就幫VVS,

595
00:24:15,080 --> 00:24:20,280
我就看到,在小朋友那裡,

596
00:24:20,280 --> 00:24:22,280
神怎樣幫他們結果,

597
00:24:22,280 --> 00:24:24,680
就是幫他們be fruitful,

598
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:30,480
就是看到很多VVS畢業的人又回來幫忙,

599
00:24:30,480 --> 00:24:34,680
就是很inspirational,去到看到神的plan.

600
00:24:34,680 --> 00:24:35,680
Very good.

601
00:24:35,680 --> 00:24:37,280
那你現在在讀什麼?

602
00:24:37,280 --> 00:24:43,680
然後你覺得神的plan for your future是什麼呢?

603
00:24:43,680 --> 00:24:49,080
我現在在讀一個Sports Science的東西,

604
00:24:49,080 --> 00:24:51,480
但是future有點blink.

605
00:24:51,480 --> 00:24:55,080
為什麼有blink?你覺得?

606
00:24:55,080 --> 00:25:00,480
我打算入Physiotherapy,但是…

607
00:25:00,480 --> 00:25:02,080
成績要很好才能入?

608
00:25:02,080 --> 00:25:06,280
是要很好,還有也不是有一個guarantee,

609
00:25:06,280 --> 00:25:08,680
有一個successful career.

610
00:25:08,680 --> 00:25:12,280
OK,那有沒有backup plan?

611
00:25:12,280 --> 00:25:18,080
我可能要騎騎肚,看看神怎樣跟我說。

612
00:25:18,080 --> 00:25:19,080
Very good.

613
00:25:19,080 --> 00:25:24,480
Well, God created the world for a relationship with you and us.

614
00:25:24,480 --> 00:25:28,480
And so, if He created us, He has a plan for us.

615
00:25:28,480 --> 00:25:29,480
Amen?

616
00:25:29,480 --> 00:25:30,280
Amen.

617
00:25:30,280 --> 00:25:34,280
好,我們給點掌聲Nathan。

618
00:25:34,280 --> 00:25:36,280
所以我們今天學了三樣東西。

619
00:25:36,280 --> 00:25:40,280
What are the three ologies that we learned?

620
00:25:40,280 --> 00:25:42,080
第一個ology是什麼?

621
00:25:42,080 --> 00:25:44,880
The first thing is trinity.

622
00:25:44,880 --> 00:25:47,480
第二是cosmology.

623
00:25:47,480 --> 00:25:50,480
第三是humanity.

624
00:25:50,480 --> 00:25:55,480
Trinity,我們要相信神創造這個世界。

625
00:25:55,480 --> 00:25:59,480
祂創造這個世界是有一個perfect plan,

626
00:25:59,480 --> 00:26:04,680
是from chaos to order.

627
00:26:04,680 --> 00:26:06,480
我們要相信祂。

628
00:26:06,480 --> 00:26:09,480
你今天有沒有相信神創造這個世界?

629
00:26:09,480 --> 00:26:12,880
Do you believe that God created the world?

630
00:26:12,880 --> 00:26:15,880
第二,Do you believe in His work?

631
00:26:15,880 --> 00:26:19,880
He created the world perfectly with a plan.

632
00:26:19,880 --> 00:26:23,480
第三,Do we believe in His presence?

633
00:26:23,480 --> 00:26:26,480
神創造了我們,是怎樣的?

634
00:26:26,480 --> 00:26:29,480
He wants to have a relationship with us.

635
00:26:29,480 --> 00:26:31,880
He wants to be with you.

636
00:26:31,880 --> 00:26:36,880
Through Jesus Christ, we can have a perfect relationship with Him.

637
00:26:36,880 --> 00:26:39,880
Let us all stand and respond in song.

638
00:26:46,880 --> 00:26:49,880
Holy Father, as we go into our groups,

639
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:52,480
may you fill these groups with the Holy Spirit,

640
00:26:52,480 --> 00:26:55,880
that these conversations would lead us closer towards you,

641
00:26:55,880 --> 00:26:57,480
a relationship with you.

642
00:26:57,480 --> 00:26:58,880
May you bless each mentor,

643
00:26:58,880 --> 00:27:00,680
that you would fill them with the Holy Spirit,

644
00:27:00,680 --> 00:27:02,480
that they would speak powerfully,

645
00:27:02,480 --> 00:27:03,880
not through their own words,

646
00:27:03,880 --> 00:27:05,280
but through you, Lord.

647
00:27:05,280 --> 00:27:06,680
And through the discussion,

648
00:27:06,680 --> 00:27:09,280
every student would know more about you,

649
00:27:09,280 --> 00:27:10,880
and become more like you.

650
00:27:10,880 --> 00:27:12,880
In Jesus' name, we pray.

651
00:27:12,880 --> 00:27:13,880
Amen.

